    <item>
      <title>Fuego directo</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/es/skills/heavy-weapons/direct-fire/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/es/skills/heavy-weapons/direct-fire/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;This specialty skill allows a hero to improve his proficiency with direct-fire heavy weapons. These weapons work just like normal firearms, requiring the user to aim them at a target. Direct-fire heavy weapons include heavy-caliber firearms, plasma guns, and renders.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Fuego indirecto</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/es/skills/heavy-weapons/indirect-fire/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/es/skills/heavy-weapons/indirect-fire/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;This specialty skill allows a hero to improve his proficiency with indirect-fire heavy weapons. These weapons can fire over or around obstacles; they deliver an area effect attack instead of an attack against a specific target. Indirect-fire heavy weapons include grenade launchers, rocket launchers, shoulder-fired missiles, and mortars.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The accuracy of an indirect-fire weapon depends on the range and the degree of success achieved on a skill check.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;accuracy-by-range&#34;&gt;Accuracy by Range&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;table&gt;&#xA;  &lt;thead&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Skill Check Result&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Short Range&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Medium Range&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Long Range&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/thead&gt;&#xA;  &lt;tbody&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Critical Failure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Miss by 4m&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Miss by 8m&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Miss by 16m&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Failure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Miss by 2m&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Miss by 4m&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Miss by 8m&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;On target&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Miss by 2m&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Miss by 4m&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;On target&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;On target&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Miss by 2m&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amazing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;On target&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Always on target&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;On target&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/tbody&gt;&#xA;&lt;/table&gt;</description>
    </item>
